# SECTION: GIT-CHECKOUTS  (public, fully reproducible — pin by commit)
# TSV: dir  commit  describe  remote
# ============================================================================
libpbnjson	c4b0611639324f36e69fbbd531b7fd6d2ca894e8	submissions/10	https://github.com/openwebos/libpbnjson.git
